DTSTAMP:20260805T031956Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T230000
SUMMARY:Full Moon Paddle
DESCRIPTION:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond\nHello All\n\nLets go enjoy th
 e Sturgeon full moon out on the water.\nPaddling under the full moon is al
 ways a great experience.\nWe might have a special guest speaker on this pa
 ddle. Please make them feel welcome to our group and to the event.\n\nWe w
 ill meet at Lake Sonoma at the Public boat ramp in Geyserville off of Rock
  Pile road.\n\n**Schedule**\n***7:00pm*** \\- meet at the boat ramp\\.\n\\
 ***\\*\\*\\ *This is the public boat ramp not the private marina.\\*\\*\\*
 ***\nUnload kayaks and get ready for the paddle. Please arrive as early as
  needed to set up your kayak.\n***7:30pm*** \\- safety meeting and OTW \\(
 on the water\\)\n**9:00pm** \\- snacks and drinks at a campsite that ***we
  will paddle out to***.\n***11:00pm*** \\- approximate return time to boat
  ramp\n\n**Skill Level**\nAll skill levels welcome\n\n**Boat Types allowed
 **\nAll kayaks\, canoes\, and SUPS are welcome\n\n**What to Bring**\nKayak
 \, SUP\, Canoe\nPaddle\nPFD - must be worn while we are on the water.\nFla
 shlight / headlamp\nextra batteries\ncamping chair\nwarm clothes in your k
 ayak and in your car\n\n**snacks and drinks to share** \\- we will ***padd
 le*** out to a campsite to have drinks and snacks and sit by a fire.\n\n**
 Parking / Launch Fee**\nI believe that the parking fee is $7.50\nA federal
  park pass is also accepted\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\
 *\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n**PLEASE READ THIS**: The orga
 nizers of this trip are not experts\, not professional paddlers and do not
  necessarily have safety training or carry any safety equipment. Each padd
 ler must have the training\, experience and equipment required to complete
  this paddle safely\, and must assume all personal risks and liabilities.\
 nYou are responsible and liable for any and all things that you do. If you
  are bringing a guest you are responsible for them and their actions as we
 ll. You are also responsible and liable for all your gear and any gear tha
 t your guest brings.\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\
 *\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Questions or Concerns**\nPlease call\nBri
 an Taylor\n707-712-3388
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/kayaking-sonoma-beyond/events/3159798
 00/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260804T220206Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T220206Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
